---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';

// PLACEHOLDER. Accurate about what this site currently is, but not legal
// advice and not reviewed. Replace before launch.
---

<LegalLayout
	title="Terms"
	description="The terms that apply to the Freem pre-launch site and waitlist."
	updated="14 August 2026"
>
	<p>
		These terms cover this website and the Freem waitlist. They do not cover the
		Freem app, which does not exist yet — separate terms will apply when it does.
	</p>

	<section>
		<h2>What this site is</h2>
		<p>
			A pre-launch page describing a product we are building. Nothing here is
			an offer to supply a service, and nothing here is financial advice. The
			figures shown are illustrative examples, not real balances.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>The waitlist</h2>
		<p>
			Joining the waitlist reserves nothing and costs nothing. It does not
			guarantee access, a price, or a launch date. We may close the waitlist,
			change what early access includes, or decide not to launch at all.
		</p>
		<p>
			Please use an email address you are entitled to use, and do not attempt
			to sign up automatically or in bulk.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>Our content</h2>
		<p>
			The Freem name, wording and design on this site belong to us. You are
			welcome to link to this page or quote it in commentary; please do not
			republish it as your own.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>Availability</h2>
		<p>
			This is a pre-launch site. It may be taken down, changed or rebuilt
			without notice, and we do not promise it will be available at any given
			moment.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>Getting in touch</h2>
		<p>
			Questions about these terms go to{' '}
			<a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.
		</p>
	</section>
</LegalLayout>
